==Battleground==
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*2 [[Maawth]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.
**3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Cyberhorn]]s spawn, delay 18~20 seconds<sup>540f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 18~20 seconds<sup>540f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns.
**3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 15.33~18.67 seconds<sup>460f~560f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Almost any [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|cat with Long Distance]] and/or [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] abilities is a good choice here. On 1-{{3c}}, [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Hurricat]] or [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] can be used to deal with the Metal Doges.
It is highly recommended to get all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from all 3 [[Into the Future]] chapters, or this stage will become a nightmare.

==Trivia==
*Mysterious Order's Japanese name, Mystery Circle (ミステリーサークル), is the Japanese term for [[wikipedia:Crop circle|crop circles]], referencing both the [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]] and [[Metal Doge]], who became a cyborg after an incident involving a silver disc in the sky.

